erator. All rights reserved.\\\"]}]}]\\nd:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L4\\\",null,{\\\"parallelRouterKey\\\":\\\"children\\\",\\\"error\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"template\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L5\\\",null,{}],\\\"templateStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"templateScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"notFound\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"forbidden\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"unauthorized\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]]}]\\ne:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L4\\\",null,{\\\"parallelRouterKey\\\":\\\"children\\\",\\\"error\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"template\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L5\\\",null,{}],\\\"templateStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"templateScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"notFound\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"forbidden\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"unauthorized\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]]}]\\nf:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$L14\\\",null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L15\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$16\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Next.MetadataOutlet\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$@17\\\"}]}]]}]\\n18:[]\\n10:\\\"$W18\\\"\\n11:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"h\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L19\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L1a\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"hidden\\\":true,\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L1b\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$16\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Next.Metadata\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L1c\\\"}]}]}],null]}]\\n13:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1d:Tb4c,\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BlogPosting\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Animal Names Inspired by Space \\u0026 Astronomy: Cosmic Ideas 🌌\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Name your pet after the wonders of the universe! From constellations and planets to galaxies and astronauts, discover stellar names for your animal companion.\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-06-17\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-07-06\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/about/\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"BestAnimalNames\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com\\\"},\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/animal-names-inspired-by-space-and-astronomy/\\\"},\\\"wordCount\\\":179,\\\"articleBody\\\":\\\" The cosmos has inspired humanity for millennia. Naming your pet after the stars, planets, and galaxies connects them to the infinite wonder of the universe. Whether you have a bright and energetic {dog} or a mysterious and nocturnal {cat}, space names offer cosmic beauty for every personality. Planet \\u0026 Moon Names Planetary names bring cosmic gravitas: \\u003cstrong\\u003eJupiter\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMars\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eVenus\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSaturn\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNeptune\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMercury\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Moon names are softer and luminous: \\u003cstrong\\u003eLuna\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eTitan\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eEuropa\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eIo\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCallisto\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePhoebe\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRhea\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Star \\u0026 Constellation Names Star names shine with brilliance: \\u003cstrong\\u003eSirius\\u003c/strong\\u003e (the brightest star), \\u003cstrong\\u003eVega\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAltair\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePolaris\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRigel\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eBetelgeuse\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Constellation names add meaning: \\u003cstrong\\u003eOrion\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eLyra\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDraco\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePhoenix\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCygnus\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Galaxy \\u0026 Nebula Names Deep space names evoke the sublime: \\u003cstrong\\u003eNebula\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAndromeda\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMilky\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Way), \\u003cstrong\\u003eQuasar\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePulsar\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCosmos\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eStellar\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAurora\\u003c/strong\\u003e. These names suggest depth, mystery, and infinite possibility. Astronaut \\u0026 Space Mission Names Honor real space explorers: \\u003cstrong\\u003eBuzz\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Aldrin), \\u003cstrong\\u003eNeil\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Armstrong), \\u003cstrong\\u003eSally\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Ride), \\u003cstrong\\u003eLaika\\u003c/strong\\u003e (space dog), \\u003cstrong\\u003eApollo\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eGemini\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eVoyager\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eHubble\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eKepler\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Space Mythology Names Many celestial names trace to mythology: \\u003cstrong\\u003eDiana\\u003c/strong\\u003e (moon goddess), \\u003cstrong\\u003eSelene\\u003c/strong\\u003e (moon), \\u003cstrong\\u003eHelios\\u003c/strong\\u003e (sun), \\u003cstrong\\u003eSol\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRa\\u003c/strong\\u003e (sun god), \\u003cstrong\\u003eOberon\\u003c/strong\\u003e and \\u003cstrong\\u003eTitania\\u003c/strong\\u003e (moons of Uranus).\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-animal-names-inspired-by-space-and-astronomy.png\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en\\\"}\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1e:T417,{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Are space names only for science enthusiasts?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Not at all! Space names carry universal beauty and wonder. Anyone can appreciate the poetry of naming a pet after the stars regardless of astronomy knowledge.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What's the most popular space pet name?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Luna is by far the most popular space-inspired pet name, followed by Nova, Stella, Orion, and Cosmo.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can small pets have cosmic names?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The contrast between a tiny hamster named Jupiter or a mouse named Andromeda creates delightful irony that makes the name even more memorable.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which space names work best for cats?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Luna, Artemis, Nebula, and Orion are particularly popular for cats. Nocturnal cats especially suit moon and star names.\\\"}}]}14:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$1d\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$1e\\\"}}],\\\"$L1f\\\",\\\"$L20\\\",\\\"$L21\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\"